<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA SET SOUTH AFRICA 356-RUN VICTORY TARGET.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA SET SOUTH AFRICA 356-RUN VICTORY TARGET.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India declared at 266 for eight in their second innings on the fourth day of the third and final test, leaving South Africa 356 to win.</p>
<p>Scores: India 410-9 and 266-8 declared, South Africa 321</p>
